**Set 2: in the app (guitar, boot room).** Write and keep `handoff_build_support_2\roadmap\bloom\make_listens.py`, reusing the AMBIENCE helpers. Guitar: `handoff_build_support_2\roadmap\robotic_1240\test_guitar_dualmono_clean.wav`, first 8 s, never overwritten. Render the guitar through `render()` with the page-default desk (boot room 6×3×8, decay 1.8, `sub_hp` on, physics default). Output to `roadmap\bloom\listen\`:
